@startuml package-structure-evolution
title Pakkestruktur før og etter refaktorering

skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
hide empty members
hide circle

top to bottom direction

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
'  FØR — Del 1 + 2 (flat, type-basert struktur)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
package "DEL 1 + 2 — Flat struktur" as Before #FCE4EC {

  rectangle "model" as M #F8BBD0 {
    rectangle "Player, Stock, Share,\nPortfolio, Exchange,\nTransaction, Purchase, Sale,\nTransactionArchive,\nTransactionFactory" as MClasses
  }
  rectangle "view" as V #F8BBD0 {
    rectangle "JavaFX views" as VClasses
  }
  rectangle "controller" as C #F8BBD0 {
    rectangle "Controllers" as CClasses
  }
  rectangle "io" as IO #F8BBD0 {
    rectangle "CSVFileHandler" as IOClasses
  }

  M <--> V
  M <--> C
  M <--> IO
  V <--> C
  V ..> IO
  C ..> IO
}

note right of Before
  Klasser grupperes etter **type**.
  Avhengigheter krysser fritt
  mellom alle pakkene → tett kobling.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
'  ETTER — Del 3 (Clean / Hexagonal Architecture)
'  Skjematisk visning — se Figur 1 for full klasse-detalj.
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
package "DEL 3 — Lagdelt arkitektur" as After #E0F2F1 {

  rectangle "ui" as UI #B2DFDB
  rectangle "application" as APP #B2DFDB
  rectangle "domain" as DOM #B2DFDB
  rectangle "infrastructure" as INF #B2DFDB
  rectangle "shared" as SH #B2DFDB

  UI --> APP
  APP --> DOM
  INF ..|> DOM : implements ports
}

note right of After
  Klasser grupperes etter **lag**.
  Alle avhengigheter peker innover
  mot domenet (Clean Architecture).

  **shared** brukes på tvers,
  men har ingen avhengigheter selv.

  Detaljert klasse-innhold vises i Figur 1.
end note

Before -[hidden]down- After

@enduml
